{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your own worst enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kicked out of therapy, blood on your hands, and nowhere to run. Shotgun Recovery offers a dark single-player campaign about mental struggle. Fight a variety of terrible monsters as you jump between nightmare and reality in 10 varied levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/extras/description_header_2.png?t=1746197966\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your head is as important as your ammo. When the dust settles; take a moment for self-care. Grab a bite to eat, pop some pills, or take a shower. For when nightmares come alive, preparedness can be the difference between waking up in a cold sweat \u2014 and not waking up at all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/extras/description_header_3_w_fade.png?t=1746197966\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reactive sanity system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over a dozen enemy types, including boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix of linear and open levels with secrets to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable Horde Mode</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2283090?t=1746197966","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746197966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/c3886a8f471ca4f1161881f94772cc80998bbf6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746197966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/c3886a8f471ca4f1161881f94772cc80998bbf6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746197966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Violence, drugs, mental illness"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your own worst enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kicked out of therapy, blood on your hands, and nowhere to run. Shotgun Recovery offers a dark single-player campaign about mental struggle. Fight a variety of terrible monsters as you jump between nightmare and reality in 10 varied levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/extras/description_header_2.png?t=1746197966\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your head is as important as your ammo. When the dust settles; take a moment for self-care. Grab a bite to eat, pop some pills, or take a shower. For when nightmares come alive, preparedness can be the difference between waking up in a cold sweat \u2014 and not waking up at all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/extras/description_header_3_w_fade.png?t=1746197966\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reactive sanity system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over a dozen enemy types, including boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix of linear and open levels with secrets to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable Horde Mode</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dreamer's Anvil"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283090/5ea246b466b0d39d6ff5dfe4822e3540168a4d08/header.jpg?t=1746197966","is_free":false,"legal_noti